+For SPEC.v0.7.0 §4.2 step 4, `Authorize` resolves ownership direction before
+grant expiry. A remote winner with a lapsed local grant therefore keeps the
+`remote_owner` park/cause reachable, so `axpane.Decide` can offer
+`attach_remote` or `takeover_offer`; a local owner with the same lapsed grant
+still refuses `lease_conflict`. The direct regression and the labelled
+arm-order plant are recorded in
+[`internal/fencing/TRACEABILITY.md`](internal/fencing/TRACEABILITY.md).
+
