+## 2026-09-21
+
+### BUG-260917-2fwf8e — fencing direction must beat lapsed-grant refusal
+
+- SCOPE: `internal/fencing.Authorize` arm precedence only. `sessrepo.CheckFencingExpiry` remains the expiry owner; no lease-chain code or Section 5.2 park vocabulary changed. The old `terminstance` grantless assertions that encoded expiry-first behavior were updated to expect the existing literal `remote_owner` park for a remote lapsed grant, with no stale-fence transition.
