+| Remote interactive owner with a lapsed local grant reaches the offer path | `fencing.Authorize(OperationRestore, ...)`, then `axpane.Decide` | `TestAuthorizeRemoteInteractiveOwnerLapsedGrantUsesRemoteOfferArm`; `TestDecideLapsedRemoteOwnerOffersOrParksByInteractiveContext/interactive_attach`; `/interactive_takeover` | 1 of 1 reported vector: direct `remote_owner` park with literal `not_owner`, never literal `lease_conflict`; composed actions are literal `attach_remote` and `takeover_offer`. |
