+## Outcome
+
+`internal/fencing.Authorize` now preserves refresh-policy validation but defers
+only the lapsed-grant refusal until after ownership direction. A remote winner
+with a lapsed local grant therefore returns the existing `remote_owner` park
+with literal `not_owner`, rather than `lease_conflict`. `axpane.Decide` can
+then emit `attach_remote` or `takeover_offer` for an interactive caller and
+`parked` for a non-interactive caller. A local lapsed grant remains literal
+`lease_conflict`; a remote unusable policy remains literal
+`invalid_arguments`.
