+| Composed `Decide`, interactive + attach admitted | `action=refused class=lease_conflict` | `action=attach_remote`, `reason=remote_owner` |
+| Composed `Decide`, interactive + attach not admitted | `action=refused class=lease_conflict` | `action=takeover_offer`, `reason=remote_owner` |
+| Composed `Decide`, non-interactive | `action=refused class=lease_conflict` | `action=parked`, `reason=remote_owner` |
