+- EVIDENCE: `TestAuthorizeRemoteInteractiveOwnerLapsedGrantUsesRemoteOfferArm` drives `Authorize` directly; `TestDecideLapsedRemoteOwnerOffersOrParksByInteractiveContext` drives `axpane.Decide` and records `attach_remote`, `takeover_offer`, and noninteractive `parked`. Neighbours are live local grant → authorized, remote noninteractive owner → `remote_owner`, local lapsed grant → `lease_conflict`; remote invalid policy → `invalid_arguments`.
+- SUITE DIFF: fencing baseline 310 PASS per-test rows; final 316 PASS rows. The normalized diff contains only six new named rows (the five arm/neighbor tests plus the remote-invalid-policy preservation test); no existing input moved across a refusal arm.
