LOGBOOK.md:2017:- NOTE: the general property. `declared_bounds_test.go` proves a bound's *obligation* is claimed; only coverage proves the gate was *reached*. A derived obligation set answers "is there a case for this?"; a coverage profile answers "did anything run it?". Those are different questions and this leaf needed both.
